7)</a>.\n</p><p>A perfect hunting place for a knight at level 60+ with 80/75 skills. You can easily get over 150k exp/h by using Brutal Strike. Bring <a href=\"#/wiki/Mana%20Potion\">Mana Potions</a> and some <a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Health%20Potion\">Strong Health Potions</a> that might come in handy if you encounter 3 or more <a href=\"#/wiki/Killer%20Caiman\">Killer Caimans</a>. You can make some profit even if you aren't picking up the <a href=\"#/wiki/Obsidian%20Lance\">Obsidian Lance</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Creatures</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Killer%20Caiman\"><img alt=\"Killer Caiman\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Killer_Caiman_3e1ab7.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Killer%20Caiman\">Killer Caiman</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">900</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1,500</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">180 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-180× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (always)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ham\">Ham</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Piece%20of%20Crocodile%20Leather\">Piece of Crocodile Leather</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-5× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Emerald\">Small Emerald</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Bunch%20of%20Ripe%20Rice\">Bunch of Ripe Rice</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Obsidian%20Lance\">Obsidian Lance</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Shimmering%20Pearl%20%28Green%29\">Giant Shimmering Pearl (Green)</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crocodile%20Boots\">Crocodile Boots</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>","quests":["killing-in-the-name-of-quest"]}